{
  "about": "Room pictures by name: the picture a room tile shows until the room has its own photo (Home Assistant area picture). Source of truth; backend/src/ha/roomPictures.json and frontend/src/lib/roomPictures.json are its copies (their tests compare them). Each type: `match` regexes (RU+EN, case-insensitive, tested on the room name; the first type that matches wins — utility first, then living rooms, so «кухня-гостиная» is a living room and «гостевая спальня» a guest room), `icon`, `files` — three webp files in www/rooms (served at /hauflo_static/rooms/<file>), `auto` — true: a room of this type shows its first picture without being asked (utility rooms, owner 12.11); false: the pictures are offered, the client / integrator chooses (living rooms). `thumbs` — the app's picker previews (frontend/public/rooms, scripts/build-room-thumbs.py). `label` — the type's name RU/EN, the group's caption in the app's picture picker (Р61: any picture of any type may be chosen). A file may serve several types (`technical` — «Сервис», «Техническое помещение», «Service» — takes three of the boiler / switchboard / server rooms'). A name no type matches gets the `fallback` type's choices and no picture of its own.",
  "base": "/hauflo_static/rooms/",
  "fallback": "generic",
  "types": [
