    "about": "Р68: pictures of a floor's / zone's tile on «Главная» (the backend and the app read this; the agent only serves the files). The same files as the rooms', no new ones. A zone's type by its name — the first that matches, else `fallback`; every zone shows its type's first picture until another is chosen or «none» (the structure editor, Floor.photo «<type>-<n>»). The order and the patterns follow the floor tile's icon (atelierDashboard.ts floorTileLook): service, outdoors, garage, terrace, else a floor of the house.",
